# Excel lock files
~$*

# F_analysis.m regenerates these on every run under AviList family names,
# which no longer match the 50 originally-committed filenames (retired 2019-
# checklist families) - so they'd otherwise show as new/untracked forever.
# The originals stay committed and untouched; only the newly-generated ones
# (which didn't exist before) are ignored.
export/family/*.eps
export/migrant_per_family.eps
